# =============================================================================
# .gitignore
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Keeps secrets and machine-local junk out of version control. This is the
# git-history counterpart to .dockerignore (which keeps the same secrets out
# of the Docker BUILD CONTEXT) -- the two files intentionally overlap on the
# "Secrets" section below, but exist for different reasons and both need to
# stay in sync if you ever rename/add a secrets file.
# =============================================================================

# --- Secrets -- never commit these ------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.azure.example

# --- Editors / OS -------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Python (backend/) --------------------------------------------------------
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.venv/
**/.venv*/
**/venv/
**/venv*/
**/*.egg-info/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/

# --- Node (build-tailwind/) ----------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# --- Logs / misc ---------------------------------------------------------------
*.log

# --- Local database dumps / backups, if you ever pull one down for debugging ---
*.sql
*.dump
snipeit_vm_deploy_key*

**/tfplan
**/*.tfplan